cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyPrep, please cite it as below, together with IMOD and the methods listed in docs/how-it-works.md."
title: "pyPrep: cryo-ET tilt-series preparation for Windows"
abstract: >-
  GPU frame alignment of dose fractions (MRC, TIFF, Falcon EER), etomo-ready
  tilt-series stacks, and automatic tomogram reconstruction with IMOD
  batchruntomo, from a desktop app or the command line.
authors:
  - family-names: Krystofiak
    given-names: Evan
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/EvanKrystofiak/pyPrep"
keywords:
  - cryo-electron tomography
  - cryo-ET
  - motion correction
  - tilt series
  - IMOD
  - EER
